@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Current product information for a customer-language document
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-products/calculations/1?customerId=1

### Compare an existing quotation
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-products/quotations/1

### Refresh only product information (use the edited value from the comparison response)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/document-products/quotations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "edited": null
}

### Missing document
GET {{baseUrl}}/document-products/quotations/999999
